 Mady here. So much for "the weekend."

 We've got all angles covered in the aftermath of the Nvidia CEO's weekend bombshell. If you missed it, hang with us and we'll catch you up. 🌉 Our AI+ Summit is returning to San Francisco on Dec. 3. Guests include Bill Gates, OpenAI CFO Sarah Friar, Blackstone president Jon Gray and more. Request an invite . 

 Today's AI+ is 1,104 words, a 4-minute read.

 
 
